{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"Tap or focus on a number and press Enter or Space to mark it in black. Checked cells are crossed out; unchecked cells remain blank. A valid board has no repeated white numbers in any row or column, no black cells that touch sideways, and a connected white area.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"hitori UI copy.fields.rules","detected_language":"es","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"hitori.copy.fields.rules","keys":["hitori.copy.fields.rules"],"locale":"es","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Toque o enfoque un número y presione Intro o Espacio para marcarlo en negro. Las celdas marcadas se tachan; las celdas no marcadas permanecen en blanco. Un tablero válido no tiene ningún número blanco repetido en ninguna fila o columna, no hay celdas negras que se toquen lateralmente, y un área blanca conectada.","record_id":"9492076e85c871a14a1671c68b722425f2f0ffa0b9e7832e3921fdadef60649d","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.4558940938750027,"source":"Tap or focus a number and press Enter or Space to mark it black. Marked cells are crossed out; unmarked cells stay white. A valid board has no repeated white number in any row or column, no side-touching black cells, and one connected white area. Check the board or request a hint when you need help.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"7deee4ca79b5818b102b91b9f79abacbe163816a265151531562cedad7e69b7e","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Toque o enfoque un número y presione Intro o Espacio para marcarlo en negro. Las celdas marcadas se tachan; las celdas no marcadas permanecen en blanco. Un tablero válido no tiene ningún número blanco repetido en ninguna fila o columna, no hay celdas negras que se toquen lateralmente, y un área blanca conectada.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
